#. fr: Le roi de la flibuste
#. column 2: Obtain a complete set of buccaneer armor consisting of a buccaneer's tricorne, a buccaneer's shirt, and a pair of buccaneer's boots.<br>※Speak to Jonathas in Old Gridania with all three items equipped.
